      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That weight you're describing is immense because rebuilding after a foundational loss is a monumental task, not a light switch. Instead of \"rebuilding\" a previous version, try thinking of this as cultivating a brand new self, even if it starts from very small, undefined seeds. Pointlessness is a natural response to such deep grief, so gently remind yourself that survival *is* a form of profound effort right now. Give yourself absolute permission to simply endure the silence for a while; that is enough for now.",
